42분 터널 (gravity-tunnel) — credits

Picture, score and sound: made entirely in code (Canvas 2D + numpy synthesis). No samples, no stock footage, no generated images.
Style: "Oscilloscope Math" from the Lemo-Opuscar library (style docs CC BY-NC; engine tools MIT).
Engine code in this folder (main.js, mix.py, subs.py, build.sh): MIT License.

